## Projects studied but not copied from

Read during design; no code taken.

- **sokojh/ai-notifier-swift** (MIT) — notification and click-to-focus patterns.
- **unoryota/ai-notify** (MIT) — agent hook wiring across providers.
- **idonecc/Coding-Done-Alert** (MIT) — documented the macOS 26 constraints that
  `UNUserNotificationCenter` requires a signing identity, and that cross-Space window
  manipulation regressed on Tahoe.
- **cfngc4594/agent-notify** — **no license file**, so nothing was copied. Its idea of showing
  the user a diff of a config change before applying it informed our installer's preview mode.
